k("fiscal.supplies_excluded %@","Does not include %@ of utilities tenants paid on top of the rent.","No incluye %@ de suministros que pagaron los inquilinos además del alquiler.","Ohne %@ Nebenkosten, die Mieter zusätzlich zur Miete gezahlt haben.","N'inclut pas %@ de charges payées par les locataires en plus du loyer.","Non include %@ di utenze pagate dagli inquilini oltre al canone.","Não inclui %@ de consumos pagos pelos inquilinos além da renda.","لا يشمل %@ من المرافق التي دفعها المستأجرون فوق الإيجار.","किराये के ऊपर किरायेदारों द्वारा दी गई %@ की उपयोगिताएँ शामिल नहीं।","不含租客在租金之外支付的 %@ 水电杂费。")
